WEBVTT

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:19.200
My role would be serving the customers every day

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:25.600
Always putting the customers first is what they say

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:32.000
I've worked for this firm almost my whole career now

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.400
But I am finding that it is getting boring somehow

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:44.800
So I am gonna break away and stand!

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:51.200
Gotta give it a try and take command!

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:57.600
What that means is I am taking the wheel!

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:04.000
Making my dream into something so real!

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:10.400
She is really demanding so it is been stressful lately

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:16.800
